@App.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107
@username = octocat

### Accounts the user follows that don't follow it back
GET {{App.Api_HostAddress}}/api/github/{{username}}/followers-not-following-back
Accept: application/json

### Both directions of the follow relationship, with totals
GET {{App.Api_HostAddress}}/api/github/{{username}}/relationship
Accept: application/json

### Recorded snapshots, newest first
GET {{App.Api_HostAddress}}/api/github/{{username}}/history?limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Readiness (includes the database)
GET {{App.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Liveness
GET {{App.Api_HostAddress}}/alive
